==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is similar in difficutly to an EoC 3 stage, but the Master A. makes this a bit more tricky. Thankfully, none of the annoying enemies can respawn, and are all melee hitters, making it possible to send in [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] to clear out the Pengs, Gories, and Kang Roos.

